## Local Android SDK configuration template
# Copy this file to 'local.properties' and set your machine's Android SDK path:
# On Windows (example):
# sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\<YourUsername>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
# On macOS (example):
# sdk.dir=/Users/<YourUsername>/Library/Android/sdk
# On Linux (example):
# sdk.dir=/home/<YourUsername>/Android/Sdk
